# Example Vault KV v2 secret at secret/fishers/ios (flat path).
# Store these fields in Vault — never commit real values.
# Seed helper: ./ci/seed-ios-vault.sh
#
# Same names work as GitHub Actions secrets (fallback when Vault is empty).
#
#   ASC_KEY_ID              App Store Connect API key id          (required)
#   ASC_ISSUER_ID           App Store Connect issuer id           (required)
#   ASC_PRIVATE_KEY_B64     base64(AuthKey_XXXXXX.p8)             (required)
#   APPLE_TEAM_ID           10-char Apple Developer team id       (required)
#   CERT_PRIVATE_KEY_B64    base64(distribution private key .pem) # optional
#   APP_STORE_APP_ID        numeric App Store Connect app id      # optional
